      "en": "**liskov** = any subtype must work in place of the original without surprises (do not make `ReadOnlyRepo.save` raise). The simpler fix is usually **composition over inheritance** — an object «has» a tool instead of «inheriting» from a big class. Deep inheritance in Python is rarely a good idea."
